{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Sails on the horizon... Why they came, we did not know... Destruction, chains...&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Code of The Savage</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG about vengeance, survival, and carving your own path through a brutal world. After escaping a slave ship, you wash ashore in chains on the island kingdom of Daneth. Alone and hunted, you must fight to survive in a land where cruelty is common and easy answers are rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/a078eda1662e6243d2d5410826bac2f6.poster.avif?t=1775586944\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/a078eda1662e6243d2d5410826bac2f6.webm?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/a078eda1662e6243d2d5410826bac2f6.mp4?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the great RPGs of the 80s and 90s, Code of The Savage combines classic non-linear exploration with a modern presentation. The world of Daneth is hand-crafted and designed to reward curiosity, danger, and discovery. Rather than burying you in lore from the outset, the game invites you to uncover its history naturally through exploration, conversation, and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/8be99afe9c7787682ed1a3f112dfedb3.poster.avif?t=1775586944\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/8be99afe9c7787682ed1a3f112dfedb3.webm?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/8be99afe9c7787682ed1a3f112dfedb3.mp4?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Daneth are more than quest dispensers. They work, eat, sleep, and follow their own routines. They have personalities, troubles, and secrets of their own, and your actions can shape how their stories unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/d01d143f7538fa6c688405290a2d8b99.poster.avif?t=1775586944\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/d01d143f7538fa6c688405290a2d8b99.webm?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/d01d143f7538fa6c688405290a2d8b99.mp4?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark, grounded RPG built around meaningful freedom. There is no single moral path, and the world is not divided neatly into right and wrong. How you survive, who you help, and what kind of person you become is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world with seamless exploration, day and night cycles, and changing weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy setting focused on vengeance, survival, and difficult choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear progression with strong player freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with branching dialogue, daily routines, and personal stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat with no transition to a separate battle screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns, wilderness, caves, and dungeons across the kingdom of Daneth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character growth through combat, magic, equipment, and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic RPG spirit with a grounded modern presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/673100?t=1775586944","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/673100?t=1775586944","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775586944","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775586944","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"Violence, language, drug use, and sexual themes"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Sails on the horizon... Why they came, we did not know... Destruction, chains...&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Code of The Savage</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG about vengeance, survival, and carving your own path through a brutal world. After escaping a slave ship, you wash ashore in chains on the island kingdom of Daneth. Alone and hunted, you must fight to survive in a land where cruelty is common and easy answers are rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/a078eda1662e6243d2d5410826bac2f6.poster.avif?t=1775586944\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/a078eda1662e6243d2d5410826bac2f6.webm?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/a078eda1662e6243d2d5410826bac2f6.mp4?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the great RPGs of the 80s and 90s, Code of The Savage combines classic non-linear exploration with a modern presentation. The world of Daneth is hand-crafted and designed to reward curiosity, danger, and discovery. Rather than burying you in lore from the outset, the game invites you to uncover its history naturally through exploration, conversation, and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/8be99afe9c7787682ed1a3f112dfedb3.poster.avif?t=1775586944\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/8be99afe9c7787682ed1a3f112dfedb3.webm?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/8be99afe9c7787682ed1a3f112dfedb3.mp4?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Daneth are more than quest dispensers. They work, eat, sleep, and follow their own routines. They have personalities, troubles, and secrets of their own, and your actions can shape how their stories unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/d01d143f7538fa6c688405290a2d8b99.poster.avif?t=1775586944\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/d01d143f7538fa6c688405290a2d8b99.webm?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/d01d143f7538fa6c688405290a2d8b99.mp4?t=1775586944\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark, grounded RPG built around meaningful freedom. There is no single moral path, and the world is not divided neatly into right and wrong. How you survive, who you help, and what kind of person you become is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world with seamless exploration, day and night cycles, and changing weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy setting focused on vengeance, survival, and difficult choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear progression with strong player freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with branching dialogue, daily routines, and personal stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat with no transition to a separate battle screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns, wilderness, caves, and dungeons across the kingdom of Daneth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character growth through combat, magic, equipment, and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic RPG spirit with a grounded modern presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Geoff Jones"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/header.jpg?t=1775586944","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"h